        <briefdescription>
<para>Given old and new tuples, initialize the corresponding request to be written to WAL. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>request</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>- request to fix </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
